stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> created
    created --> active_use: validation or permitted initial use
    created --> needs_review: incomplete, uncertain, or sensitive context
    created --> conflicted: contradictory relevant record detected
    active_use --> needs_review: evidence freshness or applicability changes
    active_use --> corrected: documented factual correction
    active_use --> retracted: authorized review finds active use unsuitable
    active_use --> superseded: later scope-compatible record becomes active
    active_use --> conflicted: material contradiction detected
    needs_review --> under_review: reviewer accepts review
    conflicted --> under_review: human resolution begins
    corrected --> active_use: corrected record passes applicable gates
    superseded --> archived: retained for audit
    retracted --> archived: retained with retraction rationale
    under_review --> active_use: resolution record supports use
    under_review --> corrected: correction outcome
    under_review --> retracted: retraction outcome
    under_review --> superseded: supersession outcome
    created --> expired: validity period ends before active use
    active_use --> expired: declared temporal validity ends
    expired --> under_review: revalidation requested
    expired --> archived: retained with expiry reason
    conflicted --> archived: unresolved conflict retained for audit
